---
import { site } from "../lib/site";
import { ActionLink } from "./ActionLink";
---
<section id="get-copper" class="get-copper wrap" aria-labelledby="get-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Small beginnings welcome</p>
  <h2 id="get-title">Make something<br /><em>of that thought.</em></h2>
  <p>Copper is growing, one thoughtful detail at a time.<br />Bring your notes and tasks together. Run Copper on your own machine.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <ActionLink href={site.releases} label="Download Copper" size="lg" />
    <ActionLink href={site.repository} label="Explore the source" variant="outline" size="lg" />
  </div>
  <p class="release-note">Early release for macOS, Windows, and Linux.<br /><a href={site.install}>Installation guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
</section>
